**Finding:** There is no `app.use((err, req, res, next) => {...})` error handler. Unhandled errors will propagate Express's default HTML error page, which includes stack traces in development and can leak them in production.

**Why it matters (OWASP A05 – Security Misconfiguration):** Stack traces reveal file paths, dependency versions, and internal logic.

