### Finding 4 — No Security Headers (OWASP A05: Security Misconfiguration) 🟠 High

**Problem:** Express by default sends an `X-Powered-By: Express` header, advertising the framework and version to attackers. No other defensive headers (CSP, HSTS, X-Frame-Options, etc.) are set.

